robopi-config (0.1.11-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Add Stress Test sub-menu under Hardware Test with entries for:
    - Motor Stress (CAN-FD motor stress, default 4h)
    - CAN Comm Stress (CAN interconnect stress, default 4h)
    - USB Stress (USB hub hot-plug, default 100 cycles)
